 "_source": "Local D2R install via CrossOver (CASC store, vanilla Battle.net client). CascLib -> casc_extract.c -> SpA1 raw-RGBA -> PNG (bbox-cropped). See extraction method notes below.",
 "_consumption": "UI should Object.assign(D2IO_ART, manifest.items) LAST (after all mr_/base_/d2io_ backup registrations) so HD wins. artUrl(name) already reads D2IO_ART by exact display name. This manifest's 'items' map is a superset -- it MIRRORS the existing inline v384 Object.assign block in bible.html (628 entries) PLUS 11 new v2 entries (3 Pandemonium keys, 2 Rejuvenation Potions, 6 Sunder Charms). It does not replace the inline block; it is offered as the single external source of truth an owner can diff against or eventually swap the inline block for (fetch-and-assign) if desired.",
